<GenAiPromptTemplate xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <activeVersionIdentifier>4RADlKiCfUL9TuNnhucMUuP8CIBcQrKVJRIX51Smyps=_2</activeVersionIdentifier>
    <description>MOCK: Drafts the narrative body of a seasonal Request-for-Proposal (RFP) from the demand forecast. Used by the Skywave Sourcing orchestration as the "hand over to a prompt template" step.</description>
    <developerName>Skywave_Sourcing_RFP_Draft</developerName>
    <masterLabel>Skywave Sourcing - RFP Draft</masterLabel>
    <overridable>false</overridable>
    <templateVersions>
        <content>You are a procurement writer for Skywave Airlines. Draft a concise, professional Request for Proposal (RFP) for the upcoming season&apos;s sourcing program.

Season: {!$Input:Season}
Estimated demand volume (units): {!$Input:EstimatedUnits}
Number of routes / locations in scope: {!$Input:RouteCount}
Forecast notes: {!$Input:ForecastSummary}

Write the RFP with these sections:
1. Overview &amp; scope of the seasonal sourcing program.
2. Volume &amp; category mix expectations (use the numbers above).
3. Product / service specifications and quality requirements.
4. Compliance, safety, and service-level standards.
5. Sustainability expectations (responsible sourcing, waste-reduction targets).
6. Commercial terms requested (unit pricing by category, volume rebates, commodity escalators).
7. Bid submission instructions and timeline.

Keep it under 500 words and business-ready.</content>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>Season</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>Season</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:Season</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>EstimatedUnits</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>Estimated Units</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:EstimatedUnits</referenceName>
            <required>false</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>RouteCount</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>Route Count</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:RouteCount</referenceName>
            <required>false</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>ForecastSummary</apiName>
            <definition>primitive://String</definition>
            <masterLabel>Forecast Summary</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:ForecastSummary</referenceName>
            <required>false</required>
        </inputs>
        <isCitationEnabled>false</isCitationEnabled>
